## What makes `repowise update` re-render every page (small repo, hook removed)
[A] .ts change only                                 → Pages to regenerate: 1
[B] workflow .yml change                            → Config files changed, all pages
[C] edit .repowise/config.yaml + .ts change         → Config files changed, all pages
[D] .ts change after C                              → Pages to regenerate: 1
init --no-claude-md --no-agents, never moved:
  state.json config_fingerprint == current config?  → False (init stamps before writing editor flags)
  first update                                      → Config files changed, all pages
after scripts/codeintel/repowise_restamp_config.py  → relocated + .ts change: Pages to regenerate: 1

