## Bugs found by running it, fixed
graphify hook install wrote an untracked .gitattributes → line moved to .git/info/attributes
claude mcp add --scope user -e K=V NAME …            → "Invalid environment variable format: NAME"; name first
[ -d "$r/.git" ] skipped git worktrees               → git rev-parse --is-inside-work-tree
session restarts killed detached builds twice        → worker is flock-guarded; local build resumes with --resume

